  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "For some time now I've been using the transform in the VRCCam to preposition the camera for Avatar uploads.  But since the latest SDK update:\n(VRCSDK-2018.11.05.17.42_Public) \nUnity no longer seems to use the transforms inputted into the VRCCam found in VRCSDK/Dependencies/VRChat/Resources/VRCCam.\n\nI'm not sure if this was intended in the latest update but it just means I have to set the position of the camera each time I upload an avatar.",
